{title: 203 - This Is the Threefold Truth}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #203 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: C}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 203}
{meta: category Jesus Christ - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[C]This is the threefold [Am]truth
[C/G]On which [G]our faith [G7]depends;
[Em/B]And with this joyful [Am]cry
[G/D]Worship begins and [C]ends.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Refrain}
[F]Christ had died! Christ has [Em]risen!
[Dm]Christ will [G7]come again!
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[C]By this we are [G/B]upheld
[C/G]When doubt [G]and grief [G7]assail
[Em/B]Our Christian fortitude
[G/D]And only [Dm]grace [G]avails
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[C]This is the threefold [Am]truth
[C/G]Which, if [G]we hold [G7]it [C]fast,
[Em/B]Changes the world and [Am]us
[G/D]And brings us [Dm]home [G]at [C]last.
{end_of_verse}
